-- pane.applescript.snippet — NOT compiled on its own.
-- This is the panes.conf line for this service. Add it to
-- lib/boot-app/panes.conf (one line), then rebuild the boot-app:
--
--   <SERVICE_NAME> Worker|cd /Users/youruser/work/companion-mac/services/<svc> && ./worker.sh
--
-- After editing panes.conf:  cd lib/boot-app && ./build.sh
-- Then cycle the boot-app on the companion (quit iTerm + open Companion-Boot.app).
